:: Cheatmenu - import NPCs
<div id="npc-import">
	<p>Choose a save file made with <em>Save to Disk</em> to copy its guests, slaves and nursery kids into this game. No changes are made to the save file itself.</p>
	<input type="file" class="npc-import-file" accept=".save,.savesbundle,.txt">
	<div class="npc-import-warning" style="display:none"></div>
	<div class="npc-import-body"></div>
</div>
<<done>>
	<<script>>setup.npcImport.bindDialog();<</script>>
<</done>>

<style>
	#npc-import .npc-import-file {
		width: 100%;
		min-width: auto;
	}
	#npc-import .npc-import-warning {
		color: #f66;
		margin: 8px 0;
	}
	#npc-import .npc-import-list {
		margin: 10px 0;
		border: 1px solid #555;
	}
	#npc-import .npc-import-note {
		color: #9a958e;
		font-size: 0.9em;
		margin: 4px 0;
	}
	#npc-import .npc-import-all {
		font-size: 0.9em;
		margin-bottom: 6px;
	}
	#npc-import .npc-import-npc,
	#npc-import .npc-import-conflict label {
		display: block;
		cursor: pointer;
		padding: 1px 0;
	}
	#npc-import .npc-import-age {
		color: #9a958e;
	}
	#npc-import .npc-import-dupe {
		color: #e0a040;
		font-size: 0.85em;
	}
	#npc-import .npc-import-conflict {
		margin: 8px 0;
		padding: 6px 8px;
		border-left: 3px solid #e0a040;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
	}
	#npc-import .npc-import-button {
		margin: 6px 8px 0 0;
	}
</style>
